# Clang build delta for the LubanCat-3 AMP kernel.
# Applied on top of lubancat_rk3576_headless.config when building with Clang.
#
# -Werror is not a codegen change; it only turns warnings into errors. The
# Rockchip vendor tree emits warnings that GCC never did, so it must be off to
# keep the Clang build (and any later LTO comparison) meaningful.
# CONFIG_WERROR is not set
